title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf metarecord field
catalog: CLI command
target: mf metarecord field
summary: Field operations scoped to the selected metarecord(s)

!! Reference

```
Field operations scoped to the selected metarecord(s)

Usage: mf metarecord field <COMMAND>

Commands:
  get     Print the field's value(s)
  set     Replace all rows of the field with the given value(s)
  add     Append one row (inverse of delete)
  remove  Remove the row(s) equal to the spec (inverse of add)
  unset   Remove the field entirely (every row → unknown)
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
```
